WEBVTT

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.720
(CHUCKLING) Now, that...
That is my father.
那…那是我父亲

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.560
He has a nice face.
他长得很帅

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.560
He looks a lot like you.
跟你很像

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.720
No.
不

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.560
No, I'm not very much
like him at all, really.
我其实一点都不像他 真的

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.040
My father's fighting in the war.
我父亲现在正在打仗

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.000
My father went away to war too.
我父亲也到远方打仗去了

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.440
But that was a long, long time ago.
不过那是很久很久以前的事了

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:43.120
-Before this dreadful winter.
-Winter's not all bad.
在这个可怕的冬天来临之前
冬天也没那么糟糕啦

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:47.040
There's ice skating and snowball fights.
可以滑冰 还可以打雪仗

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.760
-And Christmas!
-Not here.
还有圣诞节
这里没有圣诞节

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.240
No. No, we haven't had a Christmas
in a hundred years.
我们已经有一百年
没有过圣诞节了

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.600
What?
No presents for a hundred years?
什么？
一百年没有收到礼物了？

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.280
Always winter, never Christmas.
一直都是冬天
却从来没有圣诞节

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:05.360
It's been a long winter.
这是一个漫长的冬天

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:09.760
But you would have
loved Narnia in summer.
但你一定会喜欢上
夏天的纳尼亚

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.160
We fauns danced
with the dryads all night,
我们人羊会跟树精整夜跳舞

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:17.440
and, you know, we never got tired.
而且我们从来都不疲倦

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:22.280
And music. Oh, such music!
还有音乐 哦 美妙的音乐

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:27.560
Would... Would you
like to hear some now?
你…你想听点音乐吗？

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:31.720
Yes, please.
好的

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:39.000
Now, are you familiar
你熟悉…

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:42.720
-with any Narnian lullabies?
-Sorry, no.
…纳尼亚的催眠曲吗？
对不起 不熟悉

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:44.960
Well, that's good.
哦 很好

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:50.320
Because this... Probably
won't sound anything like one.
因为这个…
可能不太像催眠曲

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.280
(CLEARING THROAT)

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.800
(SOFT MELODY PLAYING)

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:09.680
(GASPS)

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:16.480
(HOOFBEATS)

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:18.000
(WHINNYING)

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:33.520
(PEOPLE LAUGHING)

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.640
(ROARING)

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:18.200
-(WHISPERS) Oh, I should go.
-It's too late for that now.
哦 我该走了
现在已经太晚了

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:21.880
I'm such a terrible faun.
我是这么坏的一个人羊

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:26.800
Oh, no.
哦 不

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.400
You're the nicest faun I've ever met.
你是我见过的最好的人羊

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.640
Then I'm afraid you've had
a very poor sampling.
恐怕那是因为你没有见过
好的人羊

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.840
No. You can't have done
anything that bad.
不 你不可能做过什么坏事

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:44.080
It's not something I have done,
Lucy Pevensie.
不是我以前做过的事情
露西派文西

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:47.640
It's something I am doing.
而是我现在正在做的事情

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.520
What are you doing?
你在做什么？

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.160
I'm kidnapping you.
我正在拐骗你

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.480
(GASPS)

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:55.640
It was the White Witch.
是白女巫

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:59.880
She's the one who makes it always
winter, always cold. She gave orders.
是她让这里总是寒冬
是她下的命令

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:02.840
If any of us ever find a human
wandering in the woods,
如果我们在树林里发现人类

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.680
we're supposed to turn it over to her.
就得把他们抓起来交给她

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:09.080
But, Mr. Tumnus, you wouldn't.
可是 吐纳思先生
你不会这么做的

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:12.640
(SNIFFLES)

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.840
I thought you were my friend.
我还以为你是我的朋友

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:25.000
Now. She may already know
you're here.
现在她可能已经知道
你在这儿了

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.480
The woods are full of her spies.
树林里到处都是她的耳目

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:29.400
(BOTH PANTING)
树林里到处都是她的耳目

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:33.240
Even some of the trees are on her side.
甚至连一些树都站在她那边

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:40.040
Can you find your way back from here?
你认得从这里回去的路吗？

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:42.280
-I think so.
-All right.
应该认得
那好

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.640
Will you be all right?
你不会有事吧？

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:54.160
Hey, hey, hey.
嘿…

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.160
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
对不起 真的很对不起

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:01.800
Here.
还给你

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:07.160
Keep it. You need it more than I do.
你留着吧 你比我更需要它

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.840
No matter what happens,
Lucy Pevensie,
不管发生什么事 露西派文西
我都很高兴认识你

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.320
I am glad to have met you.
不管发生什么事 露西派文西
我都很高兴认识你

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:20.320
You've made me feel warmer
than I've felt in a hundred years.
过去一百年来
我都没有觉得这么温暖过

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:22.720
Now go.
走吧

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.080
Go!
快走

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:37.040
PETER: Ninety-nine, 100.
…99 100

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:38.520
Ready or not, here I come!
不管准备好了没有 我来啦

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:41.840
It's all right! I'm back! I'm all right!
好啦 我回来了 我没事

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:44.040
Shut up! He's coming!
闭嘴 他过来了

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:51.480
You know, I'm not sure you two
have quite got the idea of this game.
你们两个好像不太清楚
这个游戏的规则

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.680
Weren't you wondering where I was?
你不想知道我去了哪儿吗？

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:57.360
That's the point.
That was why he was seeking you.
关键就在这儿
所以他才会来找你

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:58.920
Does this mean I win?
这是不是表示我赢了？

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.720
I don't think Lucy
wants to play any more.
我想露西不想再玩了

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.000
I've been gone for hours.
我离开了好几个钟头了

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:20.640
Lucy, the only wood in here
is the back of the wardrobe.
这里唯一的木头就是衣橱板

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:24.720
One game at a time, Lu.
We don't all have your imagination.
一次只玩一个游戏 露
我们没有你那么丰富的想象力

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:31.400
But I wasn't imagining!
那不是我想象出来的

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.160
That's enough, Lucy.
够了 露西

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:36.360
I wouldn't lie about this!
我不会撒这种谎

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.000
Well, I believe you.
我相信你

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:41.800
-You do?
-Yeah, of course.
真的吗？
当然

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.480
Didn't I tell you about
the football field in the cupboards?
我没跟你说过
浴室柜子里有个足球场吗？

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:46.920
Will you just stop?
闭嘴好吗？

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.040
You just have to make
everything worse, don't you?
你非要把事情弄得更糟是吗？

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.680
It was just a joke!
我只是开个玩笑
你什么时候才能长大？

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.400
When are you gonna learn to grow up?
我只是开个玩笑
你什么时候才能长大？

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:55.560
Shut up! You think you're Dad,
but you're not!
闭嘴 你以为你是爸爸
可你不是

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.640
Well, that was nicely handled.
处理得真漂亮

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:07.440
But... It really was there.
可是…它真的在那儿

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:11.200
Susan's right, Lucy.
苏珊说得对 露西

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.800
That's enough.
够了

